'''Puffer Planet (Merciless)''' is an [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] that was added in [[Version 8.10 Update|Version 8.10]] and appears on the '''13th''', '''14th''', '''27th''', and '''28th''' of every month. When clearing this stage, the player has a chance to unlock [[Mightycat (Rare Cat)|Mightycat]]. Unlike other Advent Stages, it is only unlocked after clearing Chapter 2 of [[Cats of the Cosmos]]. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

