'''Battle:''' Lure Puffsley to your base, then spawn Bahamut and Manic Mohawk once he does. After the first Manic Mohawk dies, send another one. Spawn Stone when Bahamut is about to hit Puffsley for the third time to tank Star Peng, then spawn Manic Lion after Bahamut hits the Star Peng and takes a damage knockback in return. When Bahamut is about to start moving, send out Bullet Train. Once Bullet Train lands a hit on Puffsley, Puffsley should die to the outer part of Bahamut’s Explosion. From here, spam everything and win. Even if Bahamut dies to the Star Peng, you still have loads of units and money to deal with the Star Peng horde.

