'''Battle:''' Spawn a Soap Cat as soon as you can: this will hold Puffsley's Comet off at the enemy base while letting the Star Pengs through. By doing this, you can easily farm up cash to start cycling Soap Cats, who will be your primary defense. They are practically immortal as long as you can consistently apply Curse on the Star Pengs using Fried Chicken Cat, thus inevitably building you a giant semi-impenetrable fortress of hygiene. Your offense comes in the form of Neo Saw Cat, Jelly Dumpling Cat and Catarzan. Out of all of them, you want to prioritize Neo Saw Cat, as they not only have insanely high DPS that shreds through Star Pengs in seconds, but also hold the lines better than your other attackers with their Warp Immunity and Resistance. Try not to run out of cash spamming Catarzans.

